    "title": "Elkhart murder conviction vacated after 26 years - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joshua Short ,\n8 hours ago ELKHART, Ind. (WNDU) - A woman charged in connection to the robbery and murder of A.J. Williams has had her conviction vacated 26 years after the case. Iris Seabolt initially pleaded guilty but told a judge she was not of sound mind when doing so during her 2004 trial. Seabolt... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
